:''For the enemies encountered in the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]], see [[Kyuubei]] or [[Incubator]].''
'''Kyubey''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 293
|rarity = SR
|name1 = Kyubey
|name2 = Kyubey & Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Kyubey & Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Kyubey seems to be a great anti-Alien tank on paper, due to having more than 75k health against them at just level 30 with all [[Enigma Fruit]] Treasures maxed, which is high, especially considering his low cost and recharge time, which can be further aided by research combos. He also works as an attacker against enemies he can outrange, such as [[Nimoy Bore]] and [[Cyberhorn]], as he packs a fair amount of DPS, and his 50% Survive chance potentially allows him to either continue dealing damage or to dismiss one more hit. However, Kyubey's three Knockbacks also weakens his ability to hold the line, even if his range allows him to be a secondary meatshield, as he will stagger and falter easily to damage, with each withstanding less damage than an equal-level [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]], who also has Warp Immunity. Kyubey also faces competition from [[Ancient Egg: N108 (Super Rare Cat)|Soap Cat]] once it becomes available, as it has only one knockback, higher effective health and a useful Weaken abiliy.

{{Job|Classification = Tanker & Melee}}

